# The M1d acceptance case (DMN-06, DMN-07): holding the combo for 2 s
# lets go of every key and pauses the mapping; holding it again resumes.
# Pad A's south holds Space; back and start are the function keys and send
# nothing. South goes down, then back, then start, which completes
# back+start at 600: the combo fires at 2600,
# which releases Space. The members go up, then south, which was held
# across the pause, and a tap of south while paused maps nothing. Back
# and start go down again, and south too, at 5000: the combo fires at
# 6100 and resumes. South, held across the resume, does
# nothing until it is pressed again at 7500.
